MyDeviceCanvas does not copy source code from AgentDeck or FrameOS. Their repositories were consulted as design references only.

AgentDeck: MIT License, as documented by its upstream repository. FrameOS: AGPL-3.0, as documented by its upstream repository. No FrameOS code is included here.

N02 read-only upstream snapshots live in the **workspace `docs/` tree** (next to `PLAN.md`, `AgentDeck-master`, `frameos-main`), outside this repository; they are references only and share no code with the project. Only the registry `docs/reference/references.lock` (URL/branch/commit/license) is tracked here. None of their source is compiled or copied into the build.

